y. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":6,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":7,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":8,"line":"Village meal: +1100 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":9,"line":"Village meal: +1250 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":10,"line":"Village meal: +1256 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":10,"line":"A runner from Emberhold, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":10,"line":"A runner from Stonebridge, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":10,"line":"A runner from Ashford, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":11,"line":"Village meal: +1275 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":12,"line":"Dorothy counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"3 for guilty. 3 against.\""},{"day":12,"line":"Village meal: +1218 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":13,"line":"Village meal: +1019 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":14,"line":"Dorothy counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"2 for guilty. 5 against.\""},{"day":14,"line":"Village meal: +1189 kcal, +1L wat