,"line":"Nipon looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":25,"line":"Village meal: +1034 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":26,"line":"Nipon shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":26,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":27,"line":"Nipon looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":27,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":28,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Nipon says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":28,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":29,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Nipon says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":29,"line":"Village meal: +1100 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":30,"line":"Nipon looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":30,"line":"Village meal: +1100 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":31,"line":"Nipon shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":31,"line":"Village meal: +1008 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":32,"line":"Nipon shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":32,"line":"Village meal: +1187 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":32,"line":"🌙 Raid — Ashford came in the night from the southwest. They carried off ~1210 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":33,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Nipon says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":33,"line":"Village meal: +1306 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":33,"line":"A runner from The Bloodied II, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":34,"line":"At the grave, Dorothy, Susan, Rodion and 1 more speak for Bao — \"Terrence trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":35,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the northwest. They carried off ~600 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":36,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the northwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":36,"line":"🌙 Raid — Ashford came in the night from the southwest. They carried off ~850 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":36,"line":"A runner from The Bloodied, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the north ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":37,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the northwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":38,"line":"🌙 Raid — Ashford came in the night from the southwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":39,"line":"⛓️ Bao brings it home: Emberhold bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":39,"line":"🌙 Raid — Ashford came in the night from the southwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":40,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Emberhold's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":40,"line":"⛓️ Bao brings it home: Thornfield bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":41,"line":"You give Emberhold 1,722 kcal from Haven's bins — real food, honestly counted. Victor weeps, openly. \"The fire network. That's what it's FOR.\" (Trust +4. They owe you — the ledger remembers.)"},{"day":41,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Thornfield's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":41,"line":"⛓️ Bao brings it home: The Bloodied bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":41,"line":"Three fires bow to Haven. But a realm isn't leverage — it's seasons. These bonds are young; tend them, keep the trust, and the court will come."},{"day":42,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to The Bloodied's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":42,"line":"🌾 Tribute from Emberhold arrives — 4,000 kcal of grain into the pantry. Their fields, our fire."},{"day":42,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":42,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from The Bloodied turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":43,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the northwest. They carried off ~800 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":43,"line":"🌙 Raid — Ashford came in the night from the southwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":43,"line":"A runner from The Bloodied III, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":44,"line":"(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":44,"line":"You accept The Bloodied's food — 2,316 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Peter clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)"},{"day":44,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the southeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":45,"line":"Nipon saw how close you've gotten to Aria. Old history has long eyes. (-2 trust)"},{"day":45,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Emberhold's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":45,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Thornfield's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":45,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,624 kcal of grain to The Bloodied's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":45,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the southeast. They carried off ~1400 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the 