ou yet.)"},{"day":16,"line":"Skylar looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":16,"line":"Village meal: +1270 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":17,"line":"Skylar shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":17,"line":"Deborah counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"0 for guilty. 6 against.\""},{"day":17,"line":"Village meal: +1075 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":18,"line":"Skylar shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":18,"line":"Village meal: +1166 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":19,"line":"Skylar shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":19,"line":"Village meal: +1285 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":20,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Skylar says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":20,"line":"Village meal: +1032 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":20,"line":"A runner from Stonebridge, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":21,"line":"Village meal: +1080 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":22,"line":"Village meal: +1080 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":23,"line":"Village meal: +1017 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":24,"line":"Village meal: +1082 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":25,"line":"Village meal: +1439 kcal, +1L wate