cal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":7,"line":"A runner from Emberhold, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":7,"line":"A runner from Stonebridge, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":7,"line":"A runner from Thornfield, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":8,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Marta says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":8,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Marta says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":8,"line":"Marta shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":8,"line":"Village meal: +1156 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":9,"line":"Marta shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":9,"line":"Marta looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":9,"line":"Marta looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":9,"line":"Hattie hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":9,"line":"Village meal: +1100 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":10,"line":"Village meal: +1052 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":11,"line":"Marta hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":11,"line":"Marta hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":11,"line":"Hattie hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — re