aybe 20s, with a buzz cut hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":5,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Kenneth says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":5,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":6,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":6,"line":"A runner from Emberhold, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":6,"line":"A runner from Thornfield, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":7,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":8,"line":"Village meal: +1053 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":9,"line":"Village meal: +1002 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":10,"line":"Village meal: +1047 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":11,"line":"Village meal: +1284 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":12,"line":"Village meal: +1235 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":13,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Kenneth says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":13,"line":"Kenneth counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"2 for guilty. 5 against.\""},{"day":13,"line":"Village meal: +1260 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":14,"line":"Fernando counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"1 for guilty. 6 against.\""},{"day":14,"line":"Village meal: +1100 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":15,"line":"At the grave, Andres speaks for Fernando — \"Esther trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":16,"line":"Kenneth counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"1 for guilty. 6 against.\""},{"day":20,"line":"Kenneth hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":21,"line":"⚡ TECHNIQUE UNLOCKED: Deep Read! You don't just read trust — you read intent. Know what they'll do next. (Your knowledge of Reading People amplifies your open_book.)"},{"day":23,"line":"Andres counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"3 for guilty. 4 against.\""},{"day":24,"line":"Leo hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":24,"line":"Ines hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":24,"line":"Tariq hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":24,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Brian says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":28,"line":"Kenneth counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"0 for guilty. 5 against.\""},{"day":28,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the northwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":30,"line":"⛓️ Leo brings it home: Emberhold bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":30,"line":"A runner from Stonebridge, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":30,"line":"A runner from Ashford, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":31,"line":"You give Emberhold 1,500 kcal from Haven's bins — real food, honestly counted. Yuki weeps, openly. \"The fire network. That's what it's FOR.\" (Trust +4. They owe you — the ledger remembers.)"},{"day":31,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Emberhold's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":31,"line":"⛓️ Kenneth brings it home: The Red Table III bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":31,"line":"A runner from The Red Table II, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":31,"line":"A runner from The Red Table III, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":32,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to The Red Table III's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":34,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,600 kcal of grain to Emberhold's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":34,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,698 kcal of grain to The Red Table III's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":35,"line":"⛓️ Leo brings it home: Stonebridge bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":35,"line":"Three fires bow to Haven. But a realm isn't leverage — it's seasons. These bonds are young; tend them, keep the trust, and the court will come."},{"day":35,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from The Red Table III turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":35,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":36,"line":"Donated Muscadine Grapes (+360 kcal). Trust +0. They'll remember this."},{"day":36,"line":"Donated Burdock (+2970 kcal). Trust +5. They'll remember this."},{"day":36,"line":"Donated Blackberry (+65 kcal). Trust +0. They'll remember this."},{"day":36,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Stonebridge's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":36,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Emberhold's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":36,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,620 kcal of grain to The Red Table III's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":36,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,570 kcal of grain to Stonebridge's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":37,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":38,"line":"(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":38,"line":"Donated Burdock (+900 kcal). Trust +1. They'll remember this."},{"day":38,"line":"Donat