"day":23,"line":"Donated Staghorn Sumac (+60 kcal). Trust +0. They'll remember this."},{"day":24,"line":"Donated Jerusalem Artichoke (+400 kcal). Trust +0. They'll remember this."},{"day":25,"line":"Donated Cattail (+120 kcal). Trust +0. They'll remember this."},{"day":25,"line":"⛓️ Jack brings it home: Stonebridge bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":26,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Stonebridge's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":27,"line":"Donated Blackberry (+260 kcal). Trust +0. They'll remember this."},{"day":27,"line":"Donated Muscadine Grapes (+90 kcal). Trust +0. They'll remember this."},{"day":27,"line":"Donated Purslane (+30 kcal). Trust +0. They'll remember this."},{"day":27,"line":"Nina saw how close you've gotten to Thong. Old history has long eyes. (-2 trust)"},{"day":28,"line":"(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":28,"line":"You accept Stonebridge's food — 1,759 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Yuki clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the northeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":29,"line":"Donated Cattail (+360 kcal). Trust +0. They'll remember this."},{"day":29,"line":"Donated Purslane (+30 kcal). Trust +0. They'll remember this."},{"day":31,"line":"Donated Blackberry (+520 kcal). Trust +1. They'll remember this."},{"day":31,"line":"Donated Muscadine Grapes (+90 kcal). Trust +0. They'll remember this."},{"day":31,"line":"Donated Staghorn Sumac (+60 kcal). Trust +0. They'll remember this."},{"day":31,"line":"⛓️ Jack brings it home: Ashford bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":31,"line":"A runner from The Bloodied II, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":32,"line":"Donated Jerusalem Artichoke (+400 kcal). Trust +0. They'll remember this."},{"day":32,"line":"You give Ashford 1,500 kcal from Haven's bins — real food, honestly counted. Ellis weeps, openly. \"The fire network. That's what it's FOR.\" (Trust +4. They owe you — the ledger remembers.)"},{"day":32,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Ashford's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":33,"line":"A runner from The Bloodied, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":34,"line":"Nina saw how close you've gotten to Thong. Old history has long eyes. (-2 trust)"},{"day":34,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the northwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":35,"line":"Donated Blackberry (+390 kcal). Trust +0. They'll remember this."},{"day":35,"line":"Donated Muscadine Grapes (+720 kcal). Trust +1. They'll remember this."},{"day":35,"line":"Donated Staghorn Sumac (+300 kcal). Trust +0. They'll remember this."},{"day":35,"line":"Donated Staghorn Sumac (+240 kcal). Trust +0. They'll remember this."},{"day":35,"line":"Donated Staghorn Sumac (+360 kcal). Trust +0. They'll remember this."},{"day":35,"line":"Donated Purslane (+1590 kcal). Trust +3. They'll remember this."},{"day":35,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":35,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Ashford turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":35,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the northeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":36,"line":"(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":36,"line":"Donated Jerusalem Artichoke (+400 kcal). Trust +0. They'll remember this."},{"day":36,"line":"You accept Stonebridge's food — 2,043 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Yuki clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)"},{"day":36,"line":"⛓️ Jack brings it home: The Bloodied bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":36,"line":"Three fires bow to Haven. But a realm isn't leverage — it's seasons. These bonds are young; tend them, keep the trust, and the court will come."},{"day":37,"line":"Donated Cattail (+840 kcal). Trust +1. They'll remember this."},{"day":37,"line":"Donated Purslane (+90 kcal). Trust +0. They'll remember this."},{"day":37,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to The Bloodied's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":37,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the northeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":37,"line":"A runner from The Hungry Road, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":38,"line":"You give The Bloodied 1,800 kcal from Haven's bins — real food, honestly counted. Nadia weeps, openly. \"The fire network. That's what it's FOR.\" (Trust +4. They owe you — the ledger remembers.)"},{"day":41,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Diplomatic Incident (Level 1). Trust builds 2x faster. You're TOO good though — once per week you can start a diplomatic incident: villagers argue, you pick the winner (+trust with them, -trust with the loser)."},{"day":41,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Generous Heart (Level 1). Donating gives 2x trust."},{"day":41,"line":"At the grave, Jason, Thong, Henry and 4 more speak for Jack — \"Ella trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":42,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Ashford turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":42,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from The Bloodied turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":43,"line":"(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":43,"line":"You accept Stonebridge's food — 1,874 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Yuki clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)"},{"day":43,"line":"✨ Ability gained: Loud Chewer (L1). Eating is 2x louder (monsters hear you). But villagers love eating beside you: trust builds 10% faster."},{"day":43,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,900 kcal of grain to Stonebridge's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":43,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Ashford's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (T